  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Realizing the importance of a large library of inflections to support your vocabulary, you spend a great deal of time training your vocal cords.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Inflections class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You learn one additional inflection. You must meet all of the prerequisites for this inflection.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Extra Inflection multiple times. Each time, select a new inflection.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truemagic-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
